cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: software
title: "Vault rPPG Collector"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Flutter collector for synchronized facial video and Polar H10
  physiological ground truth (plus operator-entered cuff blood pressure) for
  remote photoplethysmography (rPPG) research. Recordings stay on-device;
  the app does not upload participant data by default.
authors:
  - family-names: Andrade
    given-names: Felipe
    affiliation: Primatio
  - name: "Primatio"
    website: "https://primat.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Primatio/vault-vital-trace"
url: "https://primat.io"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-11"
keywords:
  - rPPG
  - remote photoplethysmography
  - biosignals
  - Polar H10
  - Flutter
  - facial video
  - synchronized recording
